QuestNode: {
	FirstQuest: {
		DisplayName: Welcome to This World!
		Description: The Beginning of the Journey
		DetailedDescription: Claim your starter gear. This world has gods in it, and monsters, and right now you have nothing.
		QuestObjective.Description: Click to claim starter items
	}

	MiningQuest: {
		DisplayName: Mining Basics
		Description: Obtain 10 {0}
		DetailedDescription: Tools need metal first. Ore veins do not come up to meet you. You dig.
	}

	MiningQuestII: {
		DisplayName: Iron Age
		Description: Collect 50 {0}
		DetailedDescription: Copper is too soft; two swings and it dulls. Iron sits deeper down.
	}

	MiningQuestIII: {
		DisplayName: Gold Rush
		Description: Collect 100 {0}
		DetailedDescription: Gold is softer than iron, but it conducts magic better and takes more shaping. Advanced gear needs it.
	}

	BrimstoneElementalQuest: {
		DisplayName: Brimstone Elemental
		Description: Defeat the Brimstone Elemental
		DetailedDescription: In the ruins of the Brimstone Crag, awaken and defeat the slumbering elemental spirit. Beware her bullet hell.
	}

	CalamitasCloneQuest: {
		DisplayName: Calamitas Clone
		Description: Defeat the Calamitas Clone
		DetailedDescription: A clone filled with hatred and a desire for destruction. Lose to the shadow and you will never meet the woman herself.
	}

	CrabulonQuest: {
		DisplayName: Crabulon
		Description: Defeat Crabulon
		DetailedDescription: In the Glowing Mushroom underground, a giant crab infested by fungi lurks. Its spores are extremely dangerous.
	}

	CryogenQuest: {
		DisplayName: Cryogen
		Description: Defeat Cryogen
		DetailedDescription: Once the Archmage of the cosmos, now sealed inside a block of ice. Break it open and it wakes up wearing crystals.
	}

	DesertScourgeQuest: {
		DisplayName: Desert Scourge
		Description: Defeat the Desert Scourge
		DetailedDescription: The former tyrant of the seas now gasps for life in the dried-up desert. Beware its massive mandibles and minions.
	}

	EaterofWorldsQuest: {
		DisplayName: Eater of Worlds / Brain of Cthulhu
		Description: Defeat the Boss of the Corruption or Crimson
		QuestObjective.Description: Defeat the Eater of Worlds or Brain of Cthulhu
		DetailedDescription: Evil is spreading. Venture into the world's lesions and eradicate the giant worm or the vile brain entrenched there.
	}

	EyeofCthulhuQuest: {
		DisplayName: Eye of Cthulhu
		Description: Defeat the Eye of Cthulhu
		DetailedDescription: As long as you feel that evil gaze, it will appear. At night, coming down out of the sky.
	}

	GolemQuest: {
		DisplayName: Golem
		Description: Defeat Golem
		DetailedDescription: Deep within the Jungle Temple, an ancient war machine is enshrined. Beware its lasers and heavy fists.
	}

	HiveMindQuest: {
		DisplayName: The Hive Mind / The Perforators
		Description: Defeat the true god of the evil biome
		QuestObjective.Description: Defeat The Hive Mind or The Perforators
		DetailedDescription: The Corruption and the Crimson each have a brain. Leave it in place and the spread never stops.
	}

	KingSlimeQuest: {
		DisplayName: King Slime
		Description: Defeat King Slime
		DetailedDescription: The ruler of all gelatinous creatures. Though it looks somewhat comical, do not let its massive size crush you.
	}

	LunaticCultistQuest: {
		DisplayName: Lunatic Cultist
		Description: Defeat the Lunatic Cultist
		DetailedDescription: At the dungeon entrance, a group of fanatical cultists is trying to prevent—or perhaps trigger—the apocalypse. Stop their ritual.
	}

	MechanicalBossesQuest: {
		DisplayName: Mechanical Bosses
		Description: Defeat all Mechanical Bosses
		QuestObjective.Description: Defeat all Mechanical Bosses
		DetailedDescription: Someone rebuilt Cthulhu's organs in steel. A pair of eyes, a skull, and a long worm.
	}

	MoonLordQuest: {
		DisplayName: Moon Lord
		Description: Defeat the Moon Lord
		DetailedDescription: The mastermind behind it all, the terror from the far side of the moon. Its eyes are not where eyes belong.
	}

	PlaguebringerGoliathQuest: {
		DisplayName: The Plaguebringer Goliath
		Description: Defeat The Plaguebringer Goliath
		DetailedDescription: A Queen Bee rebuilt by nanomachine virus. It carries plague, and a sting keeps draining you after it lands.
	}

	PlanteraQuest: {
		DisplayName: Plantera
		Description: Defeat Plantera
		DetailedDescription: Deep in the jungle sleeps a massive man-eating flower. Break the bulb and face the jungle's wrath.
	}

	SkeletronQuest: {
		DisplayName: Skeletron
		Description: Defeat Skeletron
		DetailedDescription: Only by defeating this cursed old man can you safely enter the Dungeon to explore its secrets.
	}

	SlimeGodQuest: {
		DisplayName: The Slime God
		Description: Defeat The Slime God
		DetailedDescription: The apex of the slime species, an ancient and gluttonous deity. Beware the combined attacks of its avatars.
	}

	WallofFleshQuest: {
		DisplayName: Wall of Flesh
		Description: Defeat the Wall of Flesh
		DetailedDescription: The gatekeeper of the world. Throw the Guide Voodoo Doll into the lava to release this world's ancient deity and begin Hardmode.
	}

	CeaselessVoidQuest: {
		DisplayName: Ceaseless Void
		Description: Defeat the Ceaseless Void
		DetailedDescription: One of the Sentinels of the Devourer, a mirror of nothingness from another dimension.
	}

	DevourerofGodsQuest: {
		DisplayName: The Devourer of Gods
		Description: Defeat The Devourer of Gods
		DetailedDescription: A cosmic serpent that hungers to devour all divinity. Duel it in the void, and do not let it consume you.
	}

	DragonfollyQuest: {
		DisplayName: The Dragonfolly
		Description: Defeat The Dragonfolly
		DetailedDescription: A failed attempt to clone Yharon, a mad and electrified pseudo-dragon.
	}

	ExoMechsQuest: {
		DisplayName: Exo Mechs
		Description: Defeat the Exo Mechs
		DetailedDescription: The best things Draedon ever built. All three at once, with him standing off to the side watching.
	}

	OldDukeQuest: {
		DisplayName: The Old Duke
		Description: Defeat The Old Duke
		DetailedDescription: The ancient overlord of the Sulphurous Sea depths, a combination of mutation and power. Beware its toxic steam.
	}

	PolterghastQuest: {
		DisplayName: Polterghast
		Description: Defeat Polterghast
		DetailedDescription: A monster formed by the gathering of vengeful souls who died in the Dungeon. Quell their rage.
	}

	PrimordialWyrmQuest: {
		DisplayName: Primordial Wyrm
		Description: Defeat the Primordial Wyrm
		DetailedDescription: The guardian of the deepest Abyss. An entity older than the gods themselves. Do not disturb it unless necessary.
	}

	ProfanedGuardiansQuest: {
		DisplayName: Profaned Guardians
		Description: Defeat the Profaned Guardians
		DetailedDescription: Loyal guards of the Profaned Goddess. Defeat them to weaken the Goddess's defenses.
	}

	ProvidenceQuest: {
		DisplayName: Providence, the Profaned Goddess
		Description: Defeat Providence
		DetailedDescription: The Goddess who controls holy fire and purification. Challenge her in the Hallow or the Underworld, but beware of being incinerated by holy flames.
	}

	SignusQuest: {
		DisplayName: Signus, Envoy of the Devourer
		Description: Defeat Signus
		DetailedDescription: One of the Sentinels of the Devourer, a formless assassin, a ghost of the void.
	}

	StormWeaverQuest: {
		DisplayName: Storm Weaver
		Description: Defeat the Storm Weaver
		DetailedDescription: One of the Sentinels of the Devourer, a sky worm that feeds on thunderstorms and lightning.
	}

	SupremeCalamitasQuest: {
		DisplayName: Supreme Witch, Calamitas
		Description: Defeat Supreme Witch, Calamitas
		DetailedDescription: The Brimstone Witch herself. Those clones were things she made without thinking. The screen will fill up.
	}

	YharonQuest: {
		DisplayName: Yharon, Dragon of Rebirth
		Description: Defeat Yharon
		DetailedDescription: The Tyrant's loyal comrade, a dragon that rises again like a phoenix. Knocking it down once does not finish it.
	}

	BatteryQuest: {
		DisplayName: Energy Storage
		Description: Craft a Thermal Battery
		DetailedDescription: Power needs to be stored after generation. Crafting batteries is the first step to building a stable power grid.
	}

	HydroelectricQuest: {
		DisplayName: Clean Energy
		Description: Craft a Hydroelectric Generator
		DetailedDescription: Generates power from running water. Burns no fuel; as long as the water keeps moving, it keeps turning.
	}

	IndustrialStartQuest: {
		DisplayName: Industrial Revolution
		Description: Craft a Wind Generator
		DetailedDescription: Drives machines with wind. The first machine you do not have to stand next to.
	}

	ItemFilterQuest: {
		DisplayName: Logistics Sorting
		Description: Craft an Item Filter
		DetailedDescription: Automated production lines require order. Use filters to precisely control the flow of items.
	}

	MiningMachineQuest: {
		DisplayName: Automated Excavation
		Description: Craft a Mining Machine
		DetailedDescription: No more digging by hand. Set it on an ore vein and it keeps chewing downward.
	}

	MiningMachineIIQuest: {
		DisplayName: Deep Core Drilling
		Description: Craft a Mining Machine MK2
		DetailedDescription: New power core, faster drill.
	}

	PipelineQuest: {
		DisplayName: Energy Transmission
		Description: Craft Universal Energy Pipes
		DetailedDescription: The veins connecting generators and machines. Without it, electricity is just stagnant water.
	}

	TeslaTowerQuest: {
		DisplayName: Magnetic Storm Tower
		Description: Craft a Tesla Tower
		DetailedDescription: A marvel of wireless power. The tower beams energy through the air and saves you most of the wiring.
	}

	ThermalPowerQuest: {
		DisplayName: Time to Burn
		Description: Craft a Thermal Generator
		DetailedDescription: Burn fuel to generate massive amounts of power. Though not environmentally friendly, it is the most reliable energy source in the early stages.
	}

	AnnihilatingUniverseQuest: {
		DisplayName: Annihilating Universe
		Description: Obtain "Annihilating Universe"
		DetailedDescription: A galaxy compressed onto a bowstring. At full draw, the bow is more dangerous than the arrow.
	}

	AriaofTheCosmosQuest: {
		DisplayName: Aria of the Cosmos
		Description: Obtain "Aria of the Cosmos"
		DetailedDescription: Perform the symphony of the stars. This tome summons black holes and quasars, letting enemies vanish amidst the song of the universe.
	}

	NeutronBowQuest: {
		DisplayName: Neutron Bow
		Description: Obtain Neutron Bow
		DetailedDescription: A bow forged from the core fragments of a neutron star. Every arrow carries the gravity of a collapsing star.
	}

	NeutronGlaiveQuest: {
		DisplayName: Neutron Glaive
		Description: Obtain Neutron Glaive
		DetailedDescription: A polearm with astonishing density. Wielding it requires immense strength, but no armor can withstand its slash.
	}

	NeutronGunQuest: {
		DisplayName: Neutron Gun
		Description: Obtain Neutron Gun
		DetailedDescription: A firearm that shoots micro-neutron streams. Due to their extreme density, the bullets are almost unaffected by resistance.
	}

	NeutronScytheQuest: {
		DisplayName: Neutron Scythe
		Description: Obtain Neutron Scythe
		DetailedDescription: The reaper's harvesting tool. It tears through space with ease, harvesting life like wheat.
	}

	NeutronStarIngotQuest: {
		DisplayName: Neutron Star Ingot
		Description: Obtain Neutron Star Ingot
		DetailedDescription: One of the densest materials in the universe. This metal is unimaginably heavy, humming with gravitational fluctuations.
	}

	NeutronWandQuest: {
		DisplayName: Neutron Wand
		Description: Obtain Neutron Wand
		DetailedDescription: A staff that controls gravity. Use the power of a neutron star to distort space-time and crush your enemies.
	}

	PandemoniumQuest: {
		DisplayName: Pandemonium
		Description: Obtain "Pandemonium"
		DetailedDescription: A weapon forged from countless souls melted together. Hold it long enough and you can hear them still talking.
	}

	RockQuest: {
		DisplayName: Ancient Eternal Stone
		Description: Obtain Ancient Eternal Stone
		DetailedDescription: A stone that looks completely ordinary, left over from the last Boss Rush.
	}

	TerminusQuest: {
		DisplayName: Terminus
		Description: Obtain Terminus
		DetailedDescription: The key that starts the Boss Rush. Crush it and the strongest things in the world line up to come at you.
	}

	SpearOfLonginusQuest: {
		DisplayName: Spear of Longinus
		Description: Obtain Spear of Longinus
		DetailedDescription: The holy lance that once pierced a god. It does not recognize force fields, shields, or absolute barriers.
	}

	DragonsWordQuest: {
		DisplayName: Dragon's Word
		Description: Obtain Dragon's Word
		DetailedDescription: A dragon sheds tears only once in its life, at the moment of its death.
	}

	RockQuestII: {
		DisplayName: Cycle of Conquest
		Description: Clear Boss Rush 5 times, obtain 5 Ancient Eternal Stones
		DetailedDescription: The symbol of a true warrior
	}

	AdventurerQuests: {
		DisplayName: Adventurer
		Description: The world is mine to roam!
		QuestObjective.Description: Click to Claim
		DetailedDescription: Put on these boots. The world is large and walking speed matters.
	}

	ExploreDungeon: {
		DisplayName: Gloomy Dungeon
		Description: Discover the Dungeon entrance
		QuestObjective.Description: Reach the Dungeon
		DetailedDescription: Behind the cursed brickwork waits the Dungeon Guardian. People who walk in before beating Skeletron do not usually walk out.
	}

	ExploreHell: {
		DisplayName: Abyssal Underworld
		Description: Descend into the Underworld
		QuestObjective.Description: Reach the Underworld
		DetailedDescription: Rivers of lava flow in the deepest parts of the world. It is the home of demons and the source of Obsidian and Hellstone. Watch your step.
	}

	ExploreJungle: {
		DisplayName: Jungle Expedition
		Description: Head deep into the Jungle biome
		QuestObjective.Description: Reach the Jungle
		DetailedDescription: A vibrant yet perilous green maze. The dense vegetation conceals ancient temples and deadly swarms of bees.
	}

	ExploreOcean: {
		DisplayName: World's End
		Description: Reach the Ocean biome
		QuestObjective.Description: Reach the Ocean
		DetailedDescription: The edge of the continent. Here, the sky meets the sea. Sunken ships and unknown sea monsters lie buried beneath the deep blue.
	}

	ExploreSnow: {
		DisplayName: Frozen Wasteland
		Description: Explore the Snow biome
		QuestObjective.Description: Reach the Snow biome
		DetailedDescription: Frozen year round, with wind strong enough to knock you off your feet. Penguins live here and so do wolves; only one of them is harmless.
	}

	ExploreSpace: {
		DisplayName: Sea of Stars
		Description: Fly into Space
		QuestObjective.Description: Reach Space
		DetailedDescription: Break free from gravity's shackles and touch the stars. Only by flying high enough can you see the full picture of this world.
	}

	HellLabSchematic: {
		DisplayName: Hell Blueprint
		Description: Find the Encrypted Schematic in the Underworld Draedon Lab
		QuestObjective.Description: Obtain Hell Schematic
		DetailedDescription: Draedon established an outpost in Hell to experiment with geothermal energy. Find the schematic there; it might unlock new weapon technologies.
	}

	IceLabSchematic: {
		DisplayName: Polar Code
		Description: Find the Encrypted Schematic in the Snow Draedon Lab
		QuestObjective.Description: Obtain Ice Schematic
		DetailedDescription: The low temperatures here are perfect for preserving precision instruments. Get into the lab beneath the ice and find that sealed polar technology.
	}

	JungleLabSchematic: {
		DisplayName: Jungle Draft
		Description: Find the Encrypted Schematic in the Jungle Draedon Lab
		QuestObjective.Description: Obtain Jungle Schematic
		DetailedDescription: The dense jungle conceals Draedon's biological laboratory. He studied plagues and nano-viruses there. Find that schematic to reveal the dangerous truth.
	}

	PlanetoidLabSchematic: {
		DisplayName: Exo Mystery
		Description: Find the Encrypted Schematic in the Planetoid Draedon Lab
		QuestObjective.Description: Obtain Planetoid Schematic
		DetailedDescription: In the microgravity environment of high altitude, a lab floats silently. Go there to find early design blueprints regarding the Exo Mechs.
	}

	SunkenSeaLabSchematic: {
		DisplayName: Sunken Sea
		Description: Find the Encrypted Schematic in the Sunken Sea Draedon Lab
		QuestObjective.Description: Obtain Sunken Sea Schematic
		DetailedDescription: In this tranquil underground sea, Draedon left behind research regarding Prism energy. Dive underwater and retrieve that valuable data.
	}

	AquaticScourgeQuest: {
		DisplayName: Aquatic Scourge
		Description: Defeat the Aquatic Scourge
		DetailedDescription: Once a peaceful leviathan of the clear oceans, now twisted by the toxicity of the Sulphurous Sea. In these polluted acidic waters, beware its sudden charges and toxic clouds.
	}

	QueenSlimeQuest: {
		DisplayName: Queen Slime
		Description: Defeat Queen Slime
		DetailedDescription: The crystal empress of the Hallow, ruling every sanctified gelatinous creature. Faster and deadlier than her spouse, and she flies.
	}

	BuildHouse: {
		DisplayName: Master Builder
		Description: Build a suitable house
		QuestObjective.Description: Build a valid house
		DetailedDescription: Everyone needs a sanctuary. Whether it's the Guide or other wanderers, if you provide a room with furniture, light, and walls, they will offer you their services.
	}

	CollectEvilOres: {
		DisplayName: Evil Ores
		Description: Collect evil ores
		QuestObjective.Description: Collect Demonite or Crimtane Ore
		DetailedDescription: These ores radiate an ominous aura, feeling cold and clammy to the touch. Though they originate from the world's lesions, they are essential materials for crafting powerful gear.
	}

	CollectFallenStars: {
		DisplayName: Star Collector
		Description: Collect Fallen Stars
		QuestObjective.Description: Collect Fallen Stars
		DetailedDescription: They are the tears of the night sky, falling only after dark. Collect them not only to increase your mana capacity but also to use as powerful ammunition or magical material.
	}

	CollectGems: {
		DisplayName: Gem Collector
		Description: Collect various gems
		QuestObjective.Description: Collect 5 different types of gems
		DetailedDescription: Brilliant crystals buried within the rock layers. Beyond decoration, they are vital for crafting staves and grappling hooks. Gathering gems of different colors might let you piece together the brilliance of a rainbow.
	}

	CollectHerbs: {
		DisplayName: Herb Apprentice
		Description: Collect various herbs
		QuestObjective.Description: Collect 3 different types of herbs
		DetailedDescription: The foundation of alchemy. Different plants thrive in different environments: deserts, tundras, and even the underworld. Learning to identify them is the first step to becoming a master alchemist.
	}

	CollectOres: {
		DisplayName: Ore Gathering
		Description: Collect basic ores

		QuestObjective: {
			Description: {
				Iron: Collect Iron or Lead Ore
				Copper: Collect Copper or Tin Ore
			}
		}

		DetailedDescription: Mining is the essence of survival. Copper and Iron may be common, but they are the cornerstones of escaping a primitive life. Do not despise them; even legendary heroes began by swinging a copper pickaxe.
	}

	DeepExplorer: {
		DisplayName: Deep Explorer
		Description: Explore all major biomes
		QuestObjective.Description: Complete all exploration quests
		DetailedDescription: You have been to every corner of the world, from the highest clouds to the deepest hell. There is no blank space left on the map.
	}

	ExploreCaverns: {
		DisplayName: Cavern Depths
		Description: Explore the deeper Cavern layers
		QuestObjective.Description: Reach the Cavern layer
		DetailedDescription: There is no sunlight here, only darkness and unknown creatures. Lava begins to appear, and mineral deposits become richer. Watch your step; the abyss is gazing back at you.
	}

	ExploreCorruption: {
		DisplayName: The Corruption
		Description: Explore the Corruption or Crimson
		QuestObjective.Description: Enter the Corruption or Crimson
		DetailedDescription: This land is sick. Purple corruption or crimson flesh is devouring the earth. Though filled with bloodthirsty monsters, one must enter the tiger's den to obtain Shadow Scales or Tissue Samples.
	}

	ExploreDesert: {
		DisplayName: Scorching Desert
		Description: Enter the Desert biome
		QuestObjective.Description: Reach the Desert
		DetailedDescription: The scorching sun burns the earth, and the golden sea of sand buries ancient fossils and fierce antlions. Bring plenty of water; the aridity here will drain your life.
	}

	ExploreFloatingIsland: {
		DisplayName: Floating Islands
		Description: Find Floating Islands in the sky
		QuestObjective.Description: Reach a Floating Island
		DetailedDescription: A few islands drift above the clouds, holding vaults left by an ancient civilization. Find where gravity goes wrong, or build your own tower up.
	}

	ExploreGlowingMushroom: {
		DisplayName: Glowing Mushroom
		Description: Find the Glowing Mushroom biome
		QuestObjective.Description: Reach the Glowing Mushroom biome
		DetailedDescription: A psychedelic underground ecosystem. Giant fungi emit a ghostly blue glow, illuminating the darkness. This is the home of the Truffle and peculiar insects.
	}

	ExploreUnderground: {
		DisplayName: Underground Exploration
		Description: Head deep into the underground caves
		QuestObjective.Description: Reach the Underground
		DetailedDescription: Below the dirt layer is the rock layer. Bring enough torches; there are many more layers under that.
	}

	FindLifeCrystal: {
		DisplayName: Source of Life
		Description: Find a Life Crystal
		QuestObjective.Description: Find a Life Crystal
		DetailedDescription: This red crystal pulses with vitality. Smash and consume it to permanently strengthen your physique. This is the key to survival when facing powerful enemies.
	}

	FindShadowOrb: {
		DisplayName: Core of Evil
		Description: Find a Shadow Orb or Crimson Heart deep in the evil biome
		QuestObjective.Description: Destroy a Shadow Orb or Crimson Heart
		DetailedDescription: Deep within the chasm of evil pulsates a corrupt heart or a shadow orb. Smashing them yields weapons, but beware... if you break three, something terrible will awaken.
	}

	FirstPotion: {
		DisplayName: Alchemy Basics
		Description: Brew your first potion
		QuestObjective.Description: Brew any potion
		DetailedDescription: Place an empty bottle on a table, and you have a simple alchemy station. No complex spells are needed, just the right mixture of ingredients. Drink up and feel the power of magic.
	}

	NPCVillage: {
		DisplayName: Thriving Village
		Description: Attract multiple NPCs to move in
		QuestObjective.Description: Have 5 NPCs
		DetailedDescription: Surviving alone in the wild is lonely. As you become stronger and hold more currency, more people will come to join you. Build a thriving community and let them be your support.
	}

	QueenBeeQuest: {
		DisplayName: Queen Bee
		Description: Defeat Queen Bee
		DetailedDescription: Deep within the massive hives of the Underground Jungle, breaking the larva inside will enrage the ruler of the swarm. Prepare anti-poison potions and beware her stingers and rapid dashes.
	}

	CollectorQuest: {
		DisplayName: Collection Assistant
		Description: Obtain the Collector
		DetailedDescription: This device picks up nearby drops on its own. It is where automated logistics starts. No more collecting things off the ground one at a time.
	}

	LumberjackQuest: {
		DisplayName: Timber Time
		Description: Obtain the Lumberjack
		DetailedDescription: Wood is the cornerstone of industry and construction. Say goodbye to primitive axes; this machine consumes power to automate your tree farm, ensuring a continuous supply of timber.
	}

	LifeWeaverQuest: {
		DisplayName: Reforestation
		Description: Obtain the Tree Planter
		DetailedDescription: Forest regeneration is usually a slow process. This machine uses power to precisely plant saplings, quickly restoring life to barren lands. It is the final piece of the puzzle for building a fully automated, sustainable tree farm.
	}

	IncineratorQuest: {
		DisplayName: Electric Smelting
		Description: Craft an Electric Incinerator
		DetailedDescription: Traditional furnaces are inefficient, wasting a significant amount of mineral essence. Utilizing the extreme temperatures generated by high-voltage arcs, this machine thoroughly breaks down ores, extracting double the yield compared to before. This is a crucial step towards industrialization.
	}

	ItemPipelineQuest: {
		DisplayName: Logistics System
		Description: Craft an Item Pipeline
		DetailedDescription: Pipes are the veins of industry. Run them between machines and containers and items walk themselves to where they belong, so you stop running between chests.
	}

	ThrowerQuest: {
		DisplayName: Throwing Assistant
		Description: Craft a Thrower
		DetailedDescription: Not all items are worth treasuring. This device ejects items from the logistics network, tossing them out into the world. Whether for automated crafting (like dropping items into liquids) or simply acting as a garbage disposal chute, it handles the job perfectly.
	}

	DeerclopsQuest: {
		DisplayName: Deerclops
		Description: Defeat Deerclops
		DetailedDescription: Deep in the blizzard stands a one-eyed giant deer. It does not come looking for you; you insist on looking for it.
	}

	DukeFishronQuest: {
		DisplayName: Duke Fishron
		Description: Defeat Duke Fishron
		DetailedDescription: Bait your hook with a truffle worm and a duke will bite. Pig, dragon, fish; three kinds of menace on a single face.
	}

	EmpressOfLightQuest: {
		DisplayName: Empress of Light
		Description: Defeat the Empress of Light
		DetailedDescription: Step on a prismatic lacewing in the Hallow and the furious empress will come to settle the score herself. Anger her in daylight and every one of her attacks kills in one hit.
	}

	ZenithQuest: {
		DisplayName: Zenith
		Description: Forge the Zenith
		DetailedDescription: From the copper shortsword to the Starwrath, every blade you ever swung remembers you. Melt them together, and this journey takes its final shape.
	}

	BloodMoonQuest: {
		DisplayName: Night of Blood
		Description: Live through a Blood Moon
		QuestObjective.Description: Experience a Blood Moon
		DetailedDescription: On nights when the moon turns red, monsters stop knocking; they open the door themselves. Survive until dawn.
	}

	TorchGodQuest: {
		DisplayName: The Torch God
		Description: Pass the Torch God's trial
		QuestObjective.Description: Earn the Torch God's Favor
		DetailedDescription: Plant a hundred torches underground and the master of flame will test you in person. Its favor hides within the extinguished lights.
	}

	GoblinArmyQuest: {
		DisplayName: Goblin Invasion
		Description: Repel the Goblin Army
		QuestObjective.Description: Repel the Goblin Army
		DetailedDescription: Smashing Shadow Orbs draws them in, and so does a growing settlement. Short, swarming, endless; but win, and you may pick up a captive who repairs gear.
	}

	OldOnesArmyQuest: {
		DisplayName: Old One's Army
		Description: Guard the Eternia Crystal and repel all three tiers of the Old One's Army

		QuestObjective: {
			Description: {
				T1: Repel the Old One's Army Tier 1
				T2: Repel the Old One's Army Tier 2
				T3: Repel the Old One's Army Tier 3
			}
		}

		DetailedDescription: The Tavernkeep brings a plea from another world. Set the crystal, hold the portals, and let nothing touch it. Three tiers, each meaner than the last.
	}

	PirateInvasionQuest: {
		DisplayName: Pirate Invasion
		Description: Repel the Pirate Invasion
		QuestObjective.Description: Repel the Pirate Invasion
		DetailedDescription: Once the world hardens, sails appear on the horizon. They come for your money; take theirs back, captain's belongings included.
	}

	SolarEclipseQuest: {
		DisplayName: Eclipse Hunt
		Description: Slay a Mothron during a Solar Eclipse
		QuestObjective.Description: Slay a Mothron
		DetailedDescription: On days the moon blots out the sun, daytime is deadlier than night. Everything from the horror films takes to the streets, and the fastest flier among them is called Mothron.
	}

	MartianMadnessQuest: {
		DisplayName: Martian Madness
		Description: Repel the Martian invasion
		QuestObjective.Description: Repel the Martian invasion
		DetailedDescription: Do not stare at the probe in the sky; it flies home and brings friends. Saucers, death rays, mind-control helmets; the full alien invasion package.
	}

	PumpkinMoonQuest: {
		DisplayName: Pumpkin Moon
		Description: Defeat Pumpking during the Pumpkin Moon
		QuestObjective.Description: Defeat Pumpking
		DetailedDescription: Wake Halloween night with a Pumpkin Moon Medallion. Scarecrows line up to collect heads, and the closer is a king carrying twin scythes.
	}

	FrostMoonQuest: {
		DisplayName: Frost Moon
		Description: Defeat the Ice Queen during the Frost Moon
		QuestObjective.Description: Defeat the Ice Queen
		DetailedDescription: Open the present that should have stayed wrapped and Christmas Eve goes sour. Tanks patrol the snow while the queen dives through the blizzard.
	}

	FishermanQuest: {
		DisplayName: Angler's Errands
		Description: Complete five Angler quests
		QuestObjective.Description: Complete Angler quests
		DetailedDescription: A bossy little brat lives by the sea, but his rewards are surprisingly solid. Where the fish are, the treasure is.
	}

	LifeMaxQuest: {
		DisplayName: Fountain of Life
		Description: Raise your max life to 400
		QuestObjective.Description: Reach 400 max life
		DetailedDescription: Heart crystals only carry you halfway. The rest of the road is fought and grown through. Four hundred life is the ticket to standing firm in Hardmode.
	}

	ManaMaxQuest: {
		DisplayName: Heart of Mana
		Description: Raise your max mana to 200
		QuestObjective.Description: Reach 200 max mana
		DetailedDescription: Press fallen stars into crystals and feed them to yourself one by one. Twenty points a sip, nine sips in all, and the night sky runs in your veins.
	}

	WingsQuest: {
		DisplayName: Spread Your Wings
		Description: Equip any pair of wings
		QuestObjective.Description: Equip wings
		DetailedDescription: Sky vaults, fairy feathers, demon membranes. Whatever the source, the moment wings sprout from your back, fall damage becomes history.
	}

	MoneyQuest: {
		DisplayName: First Fortune
		Description: Hold a Platinum Coin
		QuestObjective.Description: Hold a Platinum Coin
		DetailedDescription: A hundred gold coins pressed into one platinum. You probably died plenty of times earning it; merchants call that a handling fee.
	}

	ExploreAetherQuest: {
		DisplayName: The Shimmering Lake
		Description: Find the Aether
		QuestObjective.Description: Reach the Shimmer
		DetailedDescription: Tucked in a corner of the world is a lake that does not belong here. Drop something in and it comes back changed. Do not jump in to test it yourself.
	}

	HardmodeOresQuest: {
		DisplayName: Three New Metals
		Description: Gather the three tiers of Hardmode ore

		QuestObjective: {
			Description: {
				T1: Collect Cobalt or Palladium Ore
				T2: Collect Mythril or Orichalcum Ore
				T3: Collect Adamantite or Titanium Ore
			}
		}

		DetailedDescription: After the Wall of Flesh falls, smash the altars with a holy hammer and three new metals grow in the deep. Each is harder than everything that came before.
	}

	ChlorophyteQuest: {
		DisplayName: Power of Chlorophyte
		Description: Collect 30 Chlorophyte Ore
		DetailedDescription: With the machines destroyed, a glowing green metal starts growing in the deep jungle mud. It has a will of its own, and it spreads on its own too.
	}

	CalamityLoreHub: {
		DisplayName: Anomaly Survey
		Description: Something is wrong with this world
		QuestObjective.Description: Click to claim
		DetailedDescription: The sea is acid, the crags are burning, and things no field guide knows grow in the crater a star left behind. Write it all down; this world's dark side is bigger than you think.
	}

	ExploreSulphurSea: {
		DisplayName: Sulphurous Sea
		Description: Explore the Sulphurous Sea
		QuestObjective.Description: Reach the Sulphurous Sea
		DetailedDescription: One side of the world has no blue ocean, only yellowed acid water. Rain fizzes where it lands and the fish come up venomous. Cover your mouth, and do not drink.
	}

	ExploreAbyss: {
		DisplayName: Mouth of the Abyss
		Description: Dive into the Abyss beneath the Sulphurous Sea
		QuestObjective.Description: Enter the Abyss
		DetailedDescription: A downward rift splits the floor of the sulphurous sea. Light cannot follow, neither can breath, and the deeper you go, the older the things that live there.
	}

	AbyssDeepQuest: {
		DisplayName: Bottom of the Abyss
		Description: Bring back Lumenyl and Voidstone from the Abyss
		DetailedDescription: Where mining lamps cannot reach, blue-glowing crystal grows along the rock walls. Dig it out and surface alive; only then have you truly been to the Abyss.
	}

	ExploreSunkenSea: {
		DisplayName: Sunken Sea
		Description: Find the Sunken Sea deep beneath the desert
		QuestObjective.Description: Reach the Sunken Sea
		DetailedDescription: Beneath the desert hides a quiet stretch of blue. Prisms glow in the water and the clams are bigger than your house. This may be the gentlest corner of the world.
	}

	ExploreBrimstoneCrag: {
		DisplayName: Brimstone Crags
		Description: Set foot in the Brimstone Crags at the edge of the Underworld
		QuestObjective.Description: Reach the Brimstone Crags
		DetailedDescription: On one side of Hell stands a cliff that has burned longer than anyone remembers. Dark red fire seeps from the brickwork, and an elemental spirit sleeps in the ruins.
	}

	ExploreAstral: {
		DisplayName: Astral Blight
		Description: Explore the star-tainted land
		QuestObjective.Description: Reach the Astral Infection
		DetailedDescription: A star crashed into the world, and what grows in the crater belongs to no bestiary. The land is changing color, the creatures are changing shape, and this is only the beginning.
	}

	AcidRainQuest: {
		DisplayName: Acid Rain
		Description: Weather an acid rain
		QuestObjective.Description: Experience the Acid Rain event
		DetailedDescription: The clouds over the sulphurous sea are yellow. When it rains the whole sea boils, and the things in the water climb ashore with it. Bring an umbrella. Seriously.
	}

	DeliciousMeatQuest: {
		DisplayName: Delicious Meat
		Description: Obtain a piece of Delicious Meat
		DetailedDescription: Nobody knows what animal it came from, and nobody cares. Tasty, filling, doubles as a building block. Stock up.
	}

	BrimlishQuest: {
		DisplayName: Brimlish
		Description: Fish up a Brimlish
		DetailedDescription: Even the acid water has fish in it, and they look surprisingly lively. Cast your line into the sulphurous sea and see what bites.
	}

	GiantClamQuest: {
		DisplayName: Giant Clam
		Description: Defeat the Giant Clam
		DetailedDescription: The largest shell in the Sunken Sea. Quiet as a rock most days; everyone who pried it open regretted it.
	}

	CragmawMireQuest: {
		DisplayName: Cragmaw Mire
		Description: Defeat the Cragmaw Mire during the Acid Rain
		DetailedDescription: Once the world hardens, something bitey floats up through the acid rain. It has far too many teeth, and all of them point at you.
	}

	MaulerQuest: {
		DisplayName: The Mauler
		Description: Defeat the Mauler during the Acid Rain
		DetailedDescription: A shark raised on acid, with a temper to match the pH. By the time it breaches, remembering to dodge is already too late.
	}

	NuclearTerrorQuest: {
		DisplayName: Nuclear Terror
		Description: Defeat the Nuclear Terror during the Acid Rain
		DetailedDescription: At the deepest hour of the acid rain, something enormous and glowing hatches. Even the acid water pulls back from where it walks.
	}

	GreatSandSharkQuest: {
		DisplayName: Great Sand Shark
		Description: Defeat the Great Sand Shark
		DetailedDescription: The fastest hunter in the desert; the dunes are its open sea. Cull enough of its kin and the king of the pack will show up in person.
	}

	LeviathanQuest: {
		DisplayName: Anahita and the Leviathan
		Description: Defeat Anahita and the Leviathan
		DetailedDescription: The song comes first, the great shadow after. The siren's melody guides the deep-sea beast; do not stop to listen.
	}

	AstrumAureusQuest: {
		DisplayName: Astrum Aureus
		Description: Defeat Astrum Aureus
		DetailedDescription: Deep in the astral blight crouches an infected war machine. It wakes at night, and nothing grows where its treads have passed.
	}

	RavagerQuest: {
		DisplayName: Ravager
		Description: Defeat the Ravager
		DetailedDescription: A giant pieced together from flesh and masonry, every limb attacking on its own. Tear off all four before the body itself gets serious.
	}

	AstrumDeusQuest: {
		DisplayName: Astrum Deus
		Description: Defeat Astrum Deus
		DetailedDescription: Lay an offering on the astral beacon and an infected god swims down out of the night sky. Only its death opens the astral ore to your pickaxe.
	}

	BossRushQuest: {
		DisplayName: The Final Battle
		Description: Clear a Boss Rush
		QuestObjective.Description: Complete the Boss Rush
		DetailedDescription: Crush the Terminus and everything you have ever slain lines up to find you again. Kill them all a second time to put the seal on this journey.
	}

	AerialiteQuest: {
		DisplayName: Aerialite Gleam
		Description: Forge Aerialite Bars
		DetailedDescription: When the Desert Scourge dies, pale blue ore-dust settles from the sky. Light enough to float, yet sturdier than iron.
	}

	CryonicQuest: {
		DisplayName: Cryonic Crystal
		Description: Forge Cryonic Bars
		DetailedDescription: With Cryogen shattered, blue veins crystallize in the deep ice of the tundra. It does not melt in your hand; it only gets colder.
	}

	PerennialQuest: {
		DisplayName: Perennial Gift
		Description: Forge Perennial Bars
		DetailedDescription: Where Plantera wilted, a breathing green metal grows from the soil. The jungle repays its debts in its own way.
	}

	LifeAlloyQuest: {
		DisplayName: Life Alloy
		Description: Smelt Life Alloys
		DetailedDescription: Three living metals melted into one; the ingot still carries a pulse. Every high-end frame is built on it.
	}

	AstralBarQuest: {
		DisplayName: Astral Smelting
		Description: Forge Astral Bars
		DetailedDescription: With the god-worm dead, the astral veins finally yield to the pickaxe. The bars glow on their own in the dark.
	}

	UelibloomQuest: {
		DisplayName: Uelibloom in Blossom
		Description: Forge Uelibloom Bars
		DetailedDescription: After the goddess's holy fire swept through, metal flowers bloomed in the jungle mud. Smelt the petals into bars; the light stays inside.
	}

	BloodstoneQuest: {
		DisplayName: Bloodstone Tempering
		Description: Gather Bloodstone Cores
		DetailedDescription: With the goddess fallen, dark red stones float up through the lava of the Brimstone Crags. They are still beating, like hearts outside their bodies.
	}

	AscendantEssenceQuest: {
		DisplayName: Ascendant Spirit
		Description: Condense Ascendant Spirit Essence
		DetailedDescription: Phantoms, stardust, moonlight, and a stubborn will that refuses to scatter. Press them into one essence; it is enough to light a legend.
	}

	YharonSoulQuest: {
		DisplayName: Embers of the Dragon Soul
		Description: Collect Yharon Soul Fragments
		DetailedDescription: When the great dragon burned out, what remained in the flames was not ash but shards of soul, still hot. Mind your heart when you pick them up.
	}

	FruitQuest: {
		DisplayName: Gifts of Life
		Description: Gather all four life-enhancing fruits
		DetailedDescription: Strange fruit sometimes ripens beside the corpses of mighty foes. Four kinds in all, and every one pushes your life to a new limit.
	}

	DraedonPowerCellQuest: {
		DisplayName: Ancient Power
		Description: Collect Power Cells
		DetailedDescription: The lab ruins are littered with cells that still hold a charge. An energy density far beyond your generators; worth studying.
	}

	DraedonsForgeQuest: {
		DisplayName: The Master's Forge
		Description: Obtain the master craftsman's forge
		DetailedDescription: At the end of industry stands a furnace that can smelt anything. Assemble it, and your workshop will never again meet something it cannot make.
	}

	ConquerorMilestone: {
		DisplayName: Chronicle of Conquest
		Description: Defeat every mighty foe of this world
		QuestObjective.Description: Complete all hunt quests
		DetailedDescription: From King Slime to the things at the world's end, finish every hard fight there is. Few ever fill this page.
	}

	EventMilestone: {
		DisplayName: Peacekeeper
		Description: Quell every invasion and anomaly
		QuestObjective.Description: Complete all event quests
		DetailedDescription: Armies, fleets, moons from other worlds. Whatever came in numbers, you sent home.
	}

	CompletionistMilestone: {
		DisplayName: The Complete Codex
		Description: Finish everything in this book
		QuestObjective.Description: Complete all quests
		DetailedDescription: The last page of this book is reserved for whoever reads it all. By the time you close it, this world holds nothing you have not seen.
	}
}
